# M5Stack StackChan: a CoreS3 (devices/m5stack-cores3, its base, whose settings
# load first) in M5Stack's StackChan body, which adds two Feetech SCS0009
# servos that turn and tilt the head (UART1, GPIO6/7), a PY32 IO expander for
# the servo power and 12 RGB LEDs (I2C 0x6F) and an Si12T touch strip on the
# head (0x68). Source: https://github.com/m5stack/StackChan (firmware/main/hal),
# whose code is in vendor/m5stack.
# Advertise as ImpoGadget-StackChan-XXXXXX, so it is easy to pick in the Impo app.
CONFIG_HOMEHUB_BLE_NAME_SUFFIX="-StackChan"
